cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Protein List Builder for Gene Ontology (GO) Analysis
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the
  associated publication.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kosugi
    given-names: Youhei
    affiliation: Takeda Pharmaceutical Company Limited
    email: Youhei.Kosugi@takeda.com
abstract: >-
  A Streamlit application that annotates a protein half-life dataset with Gene
  Ontology terms from a UniProt export and visualises the half-life (T1/2)
  distribution of the proteins carrying each GO term as logarithmic box plots.
keywords:
  - gene ontology
  - proteomics
  - protein half-life
  - turnover
  - UniProt
  - streamlit
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-07"
